description: "React component composition rules."
globs:
  - "web/components/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components

- Prefer shared components over copy-pasted shells
- `'use client'` only when required
- Buttons need `type="button"` unless submitting forms; prefer `next/link` for nav
- Alphabetize JSX props (`key` first, `on*` last)
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md`
